{"4707710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space Ends", "steam_appid": 4707710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Space Ends, I am an indie game developer, and this is my first game. The scene is: Your spaceship crashes on a planet and you have to ward off infected Aliens. The more you kill the more points you can get to open the doors and restart the engine to the ship so you can escape. There are no guns so you don't damage the ship. But you can find swords. Gather enough points to roll the Chance Portal to get a random weapon,  or when you fight a lot of aliens some of the bigger ones might have weapons stuck on them from past warriors. Fight, Collect, And Survive and you just might make it out alive.  This is a Wave Based but also a puzzle because I have no instructions but you can beat the game good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I appreciate the support if you do end up playing. I have a discord and TikTok and I'm always open to creating with other developers. I will be making more games in the future. This is a beta for what's to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Space Ends, I am an indie game developer, and this is my first game. The scene is: Your spaceship crashes on a planet and you have to ward off infected Aliens. The more you kill the more points you can get to open the doors and restart the engine to the ship so you can escape. There are no guns so you don't damage the ship. But you can find swords. Gather enough points to roll the Chance Portal to get a random weapon,  or when you fight a lot of aliens some of the bigger ones might have weapons stuck on them from past warriors. Fight, Collect, And Survive and you just might make it out alive.  This is a Wave Based but also a puzzle because I have no instructions but you can beat the game good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I appreciate the support if you do end up playing. I have a discord and TikTok and I'm always open to creating with other developers. I will be making more games in the future. This is a beta for what's to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Its a simple Wave based game where you can only use a sword and if you collect enough points, you can escape the planet.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707710/d379f6336c81bac503566461dd439bb81d1afff4/header.jpg?t=1783946506", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707710/691b06d3f0c6d8fd67deec403be62a4bf49b1143/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783946506", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707710/691b06d3f0c6d8fd67deec403be62a4bf49b1143/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783946506", "website": "https://www.boundlessenigma.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 - 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel Core i5-2300,/ AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 660 Ti/ Radeon HD 7790<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">